id: pm-csv-njaq
title: Dry-run upserts misreport existing keys as creates
description: "Both in-memory and atomic CSV dry-run previews constructed an empty key index instead of consulting the complete tracker corpus. A row whose --key provenance already exists was reported as wouldCreate, so the preview disagreed with the real import. Load and completeness-validate the key index for dry-runs too, without performing writes."
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 1
tags: []
