completed_at: "2026-08-20T19:24:55.217Z"
claim_principal: codex
author: codex
severity: high
repro_steps: "Create an item tagged csv-key:existing; import title=Existing with --key title --dry-run; observe wouldCreate=1 before the fix."
resolution: Load and completeness-check csv-key provenance during normal and atomic previews.
expected_result: Existing keys are reported as updates with no mutations.
actual_result: Real tracker regressions pass for both preview engines.
affected_version: 2026.8.16
component: import-preview
regression: true
notes[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-20T19:24:54.331Z",codex,"GREEN: keyed normal and atomic dry-runs both report wouldUpdate=1 and wouldCreate=0 for a real existing csv-key,while performing no writes."
